      ":question/worked-solution": "Recall the difference formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n\\cos(x-y)=\\cos x\\cos y+\\sin x\\sin y.\n$$\n\nApply it to the decomposition:\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(-\\frac{19\\pi}{12}\\right)=\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}-\\frac{7\\pi}{4}\\right).\n$$\n\n$$\n\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{4}\\right)+\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)\\sin\\left(\\frac{7\\pi}{4}\\right)\n$$\n\nSubstitute the signed special-angle values and combine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right) \\\\\n&=\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{4}+\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\right) \\\\\n&=\\frac{- \\sqrt{2} + \\sqrt{6}}{4}.\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
